request.description:
Purpose:  
Retrieve the full activity timeline of a maintenance request.

Authentication:  
Required — Bearer Token (JWT)

Endpoint:  
GET /api/v1/maintenance-requests/{request_uuid}/timeline

Description:  
Returns a chronological log of all status changes, notes, image uploads, and assignments for a maintenance request. Useful for tracking the full history of a request from submission to resolution. Tenants can view the timeline for their own requests. Landlords can view timelines for requests on their properties. Admins can view all timelines.

## Success Response

Status: 200 OK

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Maintenance timeline retrieved successfully",
  "data": {
    "request_uuid": "mr-1234-abcd-5678-efgh",
    "timeline": [
      {
        "event_uuid": "evt-uuid-001",
        "event_type": "status_change",
        "from_status": null,
        "to_status": "open",
        "note": "Maintenance request submitted",
        "performed_by": {
          "user_id": 12,
          "full_name": "John Doe"
        },
        "timestamp": "2024-07-01T08:00:00Z"
      },
      {
        "event_uuid": "evt-uuid-002",
        "event_type": "status_change",
        "from_status": "open",
        "to_status": "in_progress",
        "note": "Plumber has been assigned and will visit on 2024-07-05.",
        "performed_by": {
          "user_id": 5,
          "full_name": "Jane Smith"
        },
        "timestamp": "2024-07-03T11:00:00Z"
      },
      {
        "event_uuid": "evt-uuid-003",
        "event_type": "image_upload",
        "from_status": null,
        "to_status": null,
        "note": "2 images uploaded",
        "performed_by": {
          "user_id": 12,
          "full_name": "John Doe"
        },
        "timestamp": "2024-07-01T09:00:00Z"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

## Error Response

Status: 403 Forbidden

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "You do not have permission to view this maintenance timeline",
  "errors": {}
}
```

Status: 404 Not Found

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "message": "Maintenance request not found",
  "errors": {}
}
```

## Path Parameters

- request_uuid: UUID of the maintenance request (Required)
